prompt:
A clean, front-on studio photograph of a SINGLE large white cubic gaming die resting on a plain pale surface, tilted so that THREE faces are visible at once: the TOP face, the front-LEFT face, and the front-RIGHT face. Draw dark round pips (dots) on each visible face with EXACTLY these counts, arranged clearly and well spaced so each pip is easy to count:
  - the TOP face shows exactly 2 pips;
  - the front-LEFT face shows exactly 2 pips;
  - the front-RIGHT face shows exactly 4 pips.
Use these exact pip counts on those three faces even if they are not the counts an ordinary die would show. One die, three visible faces, large dark pips on light faces, sharp and well lit. Do NOT print any numbers, letters or text anywhere in the image; show the counts only as drawn pips.
